OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FWildfires have swept across the UK
OL,7,Fcausing damage to homes, wildlife and
OL,8,Fthe environment following the driest
OL,9,FJuly on record.
OL,11,FThe government issued an emergency
OL,12,Falert to millions of mobile phones on
OL,13,FFriday evening, urging the public to
OL,14,Fnot light anything that could spark a
OL,15,Fwildfire including campfires,
OL,16,Fbarbecues and fireworks.
OL,18,FIt read: "There is a very high risk of
OL,19,Fwildfires nationally.
OL,26,@zD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
