OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,F"Residents, landowners and visitors
OL,7,Fshould not undertake any activity that
OL,8,Fcould start a fire, including
OL,9,Fdisposable barbecues, firepits, garden
OL,10,Fincinerators or fireworks."
OL,12,FFires are continuing to rage on across
OL,13,Fthe country, with the military
OL,14,Fsupporting fire crews in Wales, nearly
OL,15,F40 homes destroyed and damaged
OL,16,Ffollowing the fires in Stourbridge and
OL,17,Fa potential barbecue fire in the Lake
OL,18,FDistrict.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
