OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FMore than 1,132 wildfires have now
OL,7,Fbeen recorded across England and Wales
OL,8,Faccording to the National Fire Chiefs
OL,9,FCouncil.
OL,11,FBetween January 1 and August 12, 2025
OL,12,Fthere were 869 wildfires, in what was
OL,13,Fthen the worst year on record.
OL,15,FSo what are the government doing to
OL,16,Ftackle the issue and offer support to
OL,17,Fthose impacted? ITV News explains.
OL,19,FWhat is the government doing?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FWith a record breaking year for
OL,7,Fwildfires, the government has
OL,8,Fannounced measures to try and help
OL,9,Fthose most impacted and to help
OL,10,Fprevent further wildfires in the
OL,11,Ffuture.
OL,13,FOn Friday Andy Burnham announced the
OL,14,Fintroduction of a new fire minister,
OL,15,FBaroness Blake, who will serve in the
OL,16,FMinistry of Housing, Communities and
OL,17,FLocal Government, as part of plans to
OL,18,Fprepare the country for any future
OL,19,Ffires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FAlongside this announcement, the prime
OL,7,Fminister also introduced a ban on the
OL,8,Fsale of disposable barbecues and
OL,9,Fbrought in the army to fight fires in
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FThe Ministry of Defence confirmed that
OL,18,F200 military personal were deployed
OL,19,Fwith South Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,20,FService to battle the 20 fires
OL,21,Fthroughout the nation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
