OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FBurnham also said that the government
OL,7,Fplans to commission firefighting
OL,8,Fplanes, which are commonly used to
OL,9,Fdouse flames in Europe, the US and
OL,10,Fother countries.
OL,12,FIt is unclear yet when this might
OL,13,Factually be enacted.
OL,15,FFaced with widespread drought, Burnham
OL,16,Falso pledged to cut the red tape
OL,17,Faround planning permission for
OL,18,Fbuilding reservoirs. The last
OL,19,Freservoir to be built in the UK was
OL,20,Fcompleted in 1991.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
