OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FHow prepared is the UK?
OL,8,FThe Climate Change Committee, an
OL,9,Findependent public body that advises
OL,10,Fthe government, estimates that the UK
OL,11,Fneeds to find around #11 billion of
OL,12,Ffunding to adapt to increasing
OL,13,Ftemperatures.
OL,15,FThis includes spending on passive
OL,16,Fcooling (which involves things like
OL,17,Fbuilding design and other preventative
OL,18,Fmeasures) and active cooling, which
OL,19,Frequires powered components.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
