PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FIt also recommends investment in flood
OL,7,Frisk management measures and water
OL,8,Fstorage.
OL,10,FBurnham promised a summit with fire
OL,11,Fservices as he said they have not
OL,12,Freceived the funding required to cope
OL,13,Fwith the impacts of climate change,
OL,14,Fincluding the possibility of floods
OL,15,Flater in the year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
