PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FOn Friday he told reporters: "I can't
OL,7,Fsay today that we've done enough to
OL,8,Ffully resource them to deal with these
OL,9,Ftype of incidents, and I want our
OL,10,Ffirefighters to know that I understand
OL,11,Fhow it seems from their point of view.
OL,13,F"I'm going to convene that summit to
OL,14,Fmake sure we get in place the right
OL,15,Fsupport, including the aerial support,
OL,16,Fpermanently if that is what they deem
OL,17,Fis needed.
OL,19,F"Obviously, there's other adjustments
OL,20,Fthat we need to make in relation to
OL,21,Fclimate change."
OL,26,@nD@^OUuD@AOU{D@AOU}D@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
