OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FThe Fire Brigades Union has expressed
OL,7,Fconcerns about the current number of
OL,8,Ffirefighters, and said there are
OL,9,F"12,000 fewer firefighters in the UK
OL,10,Ftoday than in 2010".
OL,12,FThey say that at least 5,000 more
OL,13,Ffirefighters are needed nationally to
OL,14,Fhelp combat the wildfires going
OL,15,Fforward.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FThey have also called for greater
OL,7,Ffunding for specific wildfire personal
OL,8,Fprotective equipment (PPE), as their
OL,9,Fcurrent gear suited to housefires
OL,10,Frather than the lightweight options
OL,11,Fdesigned for intense outdoor wildfires.
OL,13,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner told
OL,14,Fbroadcasters on Monday that the
OL,15,Fgovernment has pledged #100 million
OL,16,Ftowards specialist equipment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FShe said: "We'll be making sure that
OL,7,Fwe come together and we design a fire
OL,8,Fservice that is able to respond to the
OL,9,Fchallenges that we face but it's clear
OL,10,Fthat these challenges are becoming
OL,11,Fmore frequent".
OL,13,FWhat could the government do?
OL,15,FIt is widely predicted that this
OL,16,Fextreme heat will continue beyond this
OL,17,Fsummer and will be a regular feature
OL,18,Fof UK weather so there is a need to
OL,19,Fprotect against wildfires in the long
OL,20,Fterm.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FSome suggestions for the government to
OL,7,Fdo this could be a long term strategy
OL,8,Fwhich would include plans for land
OL,9,Fmanagement, building developments and
OL,10,Fincreased public awareness.
OL,12,FThere may be more controlled fires to
OL,13,Freduce risk by removing dry bushes,
OL,14,Fleaves and fallen branches which fuel
OL,15,Fwildfires as well as restoration of
OL,16,Fpeat bogs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1787050071
OL,3,CWhat is the government planning to do
OL,4,Cabout UK's wildfires?
OL,6,FAlthough this current government is
OL,7,Ffocused on an increase in
OL,8,Fhousebuilding, there could be stricter
OL,9,Fregulation on their location, avoiding
OL,10,Fareas close to moorland and forests
OL,11,Fand being built with more fire
OL,12,Fresistant materials.
OL,14,FMPs on a House of Commons committee
OL,15,Fsaid earlier in the year the heat
OL,16,Fhealth alert system should be extended
OL,17,Fto include wildfire and smoke warnings.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
